WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:04.000
Nothing starts until you take action.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
If you have time to worry, then run!

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
Do I need a reason to want to help out a friend?

00:12.000 --> 00:15.000
I'm Sonic, Sonic the Hedgehog.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
I have no master, except the wind that blows free.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
Merlina, every world has its end.

00:24.000 --> 00:28.000
I know that's kind of sad, but...

00:28.000 --> 00:34.000
That's why we gotta live life to the fullest in the time we have.

00:34.000 --> 00:38.000
At least, that's what I figure.

00:40.000 --> 00:42.000
I am...

00:42.000 --> 00:45.000
The Creator!

00:45.000 --> 00:48.000
The stories of this world are...

00:48.000 --> 00:50.000
Mine!

00:50.000 --> 00:55.000
If this is your world, then it's a world that I don't want any part of!

00:55.000 --> 00:59.000
That's why I must do what I must do.

00:59.000 --> 01:01.000
I am finished with you.

01:07.000 --> 01:09.000
What is a world that goes on forever?

01:09.000 --> 01:11.000
That sounds pretty smart.

01:11.000 --> 01:15.000
That adventure's no fun if it's too easy.

01:19.000 --> 01:20.000
You fool!

01:20.000 --> 01:23.000
This no longer has anything to do with chivalry!

01:23.000 --> 01:25.000
Get out of there!

01:25.000 --> 01:26.000
Run!

01:29.000 --> 01:31.000
It was never about chivalry for me.

01:31.000 --> 01:35.000
I just gotta do what I've gotta do!

01:35.000 --> 01:36.000
That's all!

01:39.000 --> 01:40.000
Are you ready?

01:41.000 --> 01:42.000
Ready for what?

01:43.000 --> 01:46.000
If you remove that sword and defeat King Arthur with it,

01:46.000 --> 01:50.000
you shall forever be the worst of knights, slayer of kings.

01:51.000 --> 01:53.000
Guess I can't be the hero every time.

01:53.000 --> 01:54.000
It's no use.

01:54.000 --> 01:56.000
But why can't I defuse you?

01:56.000 --> 01:57.000
Huh.

01:57.000 --> 01:58.000
Because...

01:58.000 --> 01:59.000
We're Sonic Heroes!

01:59.000 --> 02:00.000
This is my power.

02:00.000 --> 02:01.000
And I'm not using it to run away anymore.

02:01.000 --> 02:02.000
I'm using it to protect...

02:02.000 --> 02:03.000
my...

02:03.000 --> 02:04.000
friends.

02:04.000 --> 02:05.000
We're Sonic Heroes!

02:07.000 --> 02:09.000
It's a troll-

02:09.000 --> 02:11.000
This is my power.

02:11.000 --> 02:13.000
And I'm not using it to run away anymore.

02:13.000 --> 02:15.000
I'm using it to protect...

02:15.000 --> 02:16.000
my...

02:16.000 --> 02:17.000
friends.

